planned anti government demonstration was to be held today in the square. \r\n\r\nSince Poland didn't take in the hordes, Biden let Putin enter Ukraine (again, just like Obama) and the \"refugees\" streamed by millions into Poland.  Among them are the corrupt gangsters...   murders are up in Krakow (and Poland)...  criminals showing up dead floating in the rivers...   a man stabbed and killed a priest in a monastery a month or two ago.  All that stuff that used to NEVER happen in Poland.  But post \"Ukraine\" it happens all too often. \r\n\r\nKrakow was/is a sweet little town, the market square is quaint as can be.  \r\n\r\nBut not tonight. \r\n", "author": "phibetared", "created": 1794070860148, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "NotPeeCee", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "POLAND ATTACKED - 5 dead - Quiet Little KRAKOW Shattered (I lived there for 3 months) - Some notes", "last_comment_created": 1794091589744, "content": "<p>There are dead people lying where I was standing 6 months ago.</p>\n<p>In sweet, quiet Krakow, Poland - which I have recommend to many on this website as a fantastic family vacation site, was shattered today.   A terrorist with a semi-automatic shot dozens and killed five people.</p>\n<p>Poland has refused the EUs and globalists demands to take in illegal hordes.</p>\n<p>Last week the Prime Minister (globalist Tusk) tried to take over the government - at least the Supreme court - when the President (whose name I can't spell) was out of town.  It was an attempt to take over the government.  It failed. So Poland politically, is tense.</p>\n<p>One source is reporting a planned anti government demonstration was to be held today in the square.</p>\n<p>Since Poland didn't take in the hordes, Biden let Putin enter Ukraine (again, just like Obama) and the &quot;refugees&quot; streamed by millions into Poland.  Among them are the corrupt gangsters...   murders are up in Krakow (and Poland)...  criminals showing up dead floating in the rivers...   a man stabbed and killed a priest in a monastery a month or two ago.  All that stuff that used to NEVER happen in Poland.  But post &quot;Ukraine&quot; it happens all too often.</p>\n<p>Krakow was/is a sweet little town, the market square is quaint as can be.</p>\n<p>But not tonight.</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 13, "score_up": 50, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "2118808625510813795", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToZ3FGNA", "is_twitter": true, "is_admin": false, "score": 79, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8928784, "raw_content": "", "author": "Belleoffreedom", "created": 1794061758923, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "BoringOldMaga", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "twitter.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://twitter.com/SecKennedy/status/2118808625510813795", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "\n\nSecretary Kennedy\n\n@SecKennedy\n\u00b7\nNext to me, Stephen Miller is the strongest MAHA supporter in the administration. It\u2019s time to unleash the Kraken.", "last_comment_created": 1794068665971, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_