 we didn't listen.&quot; Blah blah.</p>\n<p>We ranted from the rafters about illegals invading and voting, about massive election fraud from 2020 to today, even got the House to pass the Save America Act based on this obvious truth, but now this week, everyone's pretending the elections are fair, the exit polls are accurate, and somehow the left won.</p>\n<p>You're telling me God-fearing Texans elected a weirdo heretic perv to represent them in the Senate to send Trump a message?</p>\n<p>I'm all out of profanities. The problem the Save America Act was trying to solve STILL PERSISTS!  Yes, hate on John Thune. But the FRAUD continues. We have to stop pretending it isn't and FIGHT THE FRAUD.</p>\n<p>Why can't Trump and Republicans get their heads around this reality?</p>\n", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 7, "score_up": 41, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"status": 200}, "post_flair_text": "", "archive_id": ""}, {"is_locked": false, "tweet_id": "", "sticky_comment": 0, "is_video_mp4": false, "type": "link", "uuid": "1AToZ4MHa9", "is_twitter": false, "is_admin": false, "score": 23, "suggested_sort": 0, "post_flair_class": "", "id": 8929275, "raw_content": "", "author": "dukeofdoorcounty", "created": 1794084928103, "profile_picture": "", "community": "TheDonald", "ad_tier": 2, "last_comment_author": "", "is_video": false, "video_link": "", "is_new_user": false, "domain": "media.scored.co", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://media.scored.co/post/47m88nIXgJm9.jpeg", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "A neighbor posted this.  Al-Buqqi's", "last_comment_created": 1794084928100, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied":